    "text": "Urban transportation systems face critical challenges in balancing efficiency, re- silience, and sustainability, particularly under infrastructure disruptions. This study presents a multi-methodological framework to address post-disaster traffic optimiza- tion, multimodal network equity, and sustainable mobility planning in Baltimore, Mary- land."
  },
  {
